<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Whose Side Are You On</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Løvesick</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sorry Doesn't Fix A Broken Heart</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2C9ZxCX1Sq8WhAsWxBq5EC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.990" end="00:27.330">I've got to change my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.330" end="00:33.780">Too many times, you just string me along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.780" end="00:37.310">Pass by the window, what's in it for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.310" end="00:43.660">Just some notes on your palm to read</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.660" end="00:50.950">Whose side are you on, anyway?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.950" end="00:55.460">You've got to get back to the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.460" end="01:03.460">I know my lines in the sand washed away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.520" end="01:09.950">I've got to, I've got to change my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.950" end="01:16.230">They threw the whole mess into the ocean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.230" end="01:20.720">While filling out forms, fuffiled some fictional chores</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.720" end="01:27.140">Now I've, I've got to change my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.140" end="01:32.500">A cheaper suit or a handful of days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.500" end="01:37.000">Blessed all the blank walls as they fall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.000" end="01:43.410">Was it some rule you said could bend?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.410" end="01:48.820">Or some corners to cut again?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.820" end="01:56.030">Whose side are you on anyway?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.030" end="02:00.690">You've got to get back to the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.690" end="02:07.880">I know my lines in the sand washed away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.880" end="02:15.880">I've got to, I've got to change my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.570" end="02:29.570">I've got to change my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.750" end="02:42.750" /></div></body></tt>